### ── 3. Tesla Model 3 long-range review
POST http://localhost:8080/articles/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "articleId": "motortrend-tesla-model3-2025-review",
  "slug": "2025-tesla-model-3-long-range-review",
  "title": "2025 Tesla Model 3 Long Range Review: Refined Yet Familiar",
  "articleType": "first_drive",
  "author": "Kristen Lee",
  "publishDate": "2025-02-18",
  "updatedDate": null,

  "vehicles": [
