  "verdict": "For families prioritizing reliability, fuel economy, and resale value under $40,000, the 2025 Honda CR-V Sport Hybrid is our overall pick. It combines 40 mpg combined with genuine three-row utility, a spacious cabin, and Honda's strong reliability history. Competitors offer specific strengths — the Toyota RAV4 Hybrid's off-road trim, the Hyundai Tucson's tech — but the CR-V wins on the balance of virtues that matter most to family buyers.",
  "pros": "Excellent fuel economy, spacious interior, strong safety scores, Honda reliability, good resale value",
